# 状态管理规范

本项目使用 Zustand 进行状态管理，所有状态必须遵循以下规范。

## Store 文件位置

所有 Store 必须在 `src/stores/` 目录下，通过 `src/stores/index.ts` 统一导出。

```
src/stores/
├── index.ts          # 统一导出
├── uiStore.ts        # UI 状态
├── strategyStore.ts  # 策略状态
├── portfolioStore.ts # 投资组合状态
├── containerStore.ts # 容器状态
├── backtestStore.ts  # 回测状态
├── positionStore.ts  # 持仓状态
└── dataMarketStore.ts # 数据市场状态
```

## Store 结构

### 4.1 标准 Store 模板

```typescript
import { create } from 'zustand';

interface State {
  items: Item[];
  selectedId: string | null;
}

interface Actions {
  addItem: (item: Item) => void;
  removeItem: (id: string) => void;
  selectItem: (id: string | null) => void;
}

export const useStore = create<State & Actions>()((set, get) => ({
  // State
  items: [],
  selectedId: null,

  // Actions
  addItem: (item) => set(state => ({
    items: [...state.items, item],
  })),
  removeItem: (id) => set(state => ({
    items: state.items.filter(i => i.id !== id),
  })),
  selectItem: (id) => set({ selectedId: id }),
}));

// Selectors（放在文件底部）
export const useItems = () => useStore(state => state.items);
export const useSelectedId = () => useStore(state => state.selectedId);
```

## 状态类型

### 5.1 useState 必须提供类型

```typescript
// 禁止
const [data, setData] = useState(null);
const [loading, setLoading] = useState(undefined);

// 正确
const [data, setData] = useState<Strategy[]>([]);
const [loading, setLoading] = useState<boolean>(false);
const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);
```

### 5.2 复杂状态使用接口

```typescript
interface LoadingState {
  isLoading: boolean;
  progress: number;
  error: string | null;
}

const [state, setState] = useState<LoadingState>({
  isLoading: false,
  progress: 0,
  error: null,
});
```

## 状态更新模式

### 5.3 使用函数式更新

```typescript
// 避免依赖当前状态
setState(prev => ({
  ...prev,
  items: [...prev.items, newItem],
}));
```

### 5.4 复杂更新使用 get()

```typescript
updateItem: (id, updates) => set(state => {
  const items = state.items.map(item =>
    item.id === id ? { ...item, ...updates } : item
  );
  return { items };
}),

// 使用 get() 获取派生状态
recalculateAllocations: () => {
  const portfolio = get().getSelectedPortfolio();
  if (!portfolio) return;
  // ... 计算逻辑
}
```

## Selectors

### 5.5 派生状态使用 Selector

```typescript
// 在组件中使用
const activeItems = useStore(state => 
  state.items.filter(item => item.status === 'active')
);

// 或使用自定义 Hook
export const useActiveItems = () => useStore(state =>
  state.items.filter(item => item.status === 'active')
);
```

### 5.6 复杂 Selector 提取

```typescript
// 避免在组件内重复复杂逻辑
const selectedItem = useStore(state => {
  const { items, selectedId } = state;
  return items.find(item => item.id === selectedId) ?? null;
});
```

## Store 命名规范

| 名称 | 文件 | Hook |
|------|------|------|
| UI Store | `uiStore.ts` | `useUIStore` |
| Strategy Store | `strategyStore.ts` | `useStrategyStore` |
| Portfolio Store | `portfolioStore.ts` | `usePortfolioStore` |
| Container Store | `containerStore.ts` | `useContainerStore` |
| Backtest Store | `backtestStore.ts` | `useBacktestStore` |

## 导出规范

所有 Store 必须从 `src/stores/index.ts` 导出：

```typescript
// src/stores/index.ts
export { useUIStore, useTheme, ... } from './uiStore';
export { useStrategyStore, useStrategies, ... } from './strategyStore';
export { usePortfolioStore, usePortfolios, ... } from './portfolioStore';
export { useContainerStore, useContainers, ... } from './containerStore';
export { useBacktestStore } from './backtestStore';
export { usePositionStore } from './positionStore';
export { useDataMarketStore } from './dataMarketStore';
```

## 禁止的行为

1. **禁止在组件内直接修改 store 状态**
2. **禁止在 store 外部定义共享状态**
3. **禁止使用多个 store 实例**
4. **禁止在 selector 内进行副作用操作**
